      <div class="note-box"><strong>Important disclaimer:</strong> This guide is for entertainment, journaling and self-reflection only. It is not medical, legal, financial, psychological or life-decision advice.</div>
      
<p class="lead">Birth month personality content works best when it is simple, kind and flexible. Rather than claiming that a month defines you, this guide uses each month as a symbolic prompt for self-awareness.</p>
<h2>Month themes at a glance</h2>
